  <item>
    <title>016.《后室》：不要温和地走入那个黄色房间｜影视万花镜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6adc94f8c96c8942ec118faa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6adc94f8c96c8942ec118faa</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 08:03:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a>《后室》有多恐怖，为啥有人硬着头皮也要看完？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a></span><strong><span>剧透预警</span></strong><span>：后室是啥，怎么来的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a>弗洛伊德只吓西方人？东西方恐怖片的差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a>后室惊现心理咨询师，咨询技术点（tu）评（cao）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a>先学医还是先看病？创伤在各个方面的影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a>好奇害死猫，在心理咨询中感到不舒服被质疑要怎么办？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">27:54</a>打破边界：心理咨询师保命的反向教材</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">30:01</a>最深的恐怖来自不确定</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 十八层地狱大逃杀，内心创伤的再现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2688">44:48</a> 是伤口也是力量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3017">50:17</a>恐怖电影大讨论：鬼月故事集变万圣节特辑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3773">01:02:53</a> 专业时间：关于创伤</span></p><p><strong><span>｜本期提及｜</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>影视</span></p></li></ul><p><span>《后室》（2026）及</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13N4y1G7wR/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=f066fe6f6df6fbb3a6205df4e523773d" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13N4y1G7wR/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=f066fe6f6df6fbb3a6205df4e523773d"><span>前作短片集</span></a></p><p><span>《黑天鹅》（2010）</span></p><p><span>《午夜凶铃》（1998）</span></p><p><span>《咒怨》（2002）</span></p><p><span>《穆赫兰道》（2001）</span></p><p><span>《古镜怪谈 怪谈之魔镜》（1999）</span></p><ul><li><p><span>书籍</span></p></li></ul><p><span>《身体从未忘记》巴塞尔·范德考克</span></p><p><span>《大厦》卫斯理</span></p><p><strong><span>｜制作团队｜</span></strong></p><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><p><span>剪辑：</span><strong><span>除号</span></strong></p><p><span>时间线：</span><strong><span>陆西恩</span></strong></p><p><span>封面：</span><strong><span>陆西恩</span></strong></p>]]></description>
