  <item>
    <title>015.《中年之路》：寻找自我的英雄之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b3cda6772ac2295b0219c7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b3cda6772ac2295b0219c7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 08:56:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>迟到两年的读书分享：中年之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 缘起：作者和主播在40岁的同频共振</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> 中年之后的生理变化</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>步入中年心理转变 暨 主播大型凡尔赛现场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 小白：当努力和成就不再让人快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> 凯丁：意识到人生需要一点点积累，努力也是一种天份</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1131">18:51</a> 陆西恩：当服从权威不再带来回报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a> 除号：中年之路的预热，从思考转向体验和行动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1661">27:41</a> 没有完美的童年，只有不断被环境塑造的我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 当旧有模式不能维系，是要穿越痛苦获得新生or消灭痛苦？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>撤回投射，找到自己</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2132">35:32</a> 到了两边都能理解的年纪：理解父母，成为不太一样的父母</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a> 亲密关系中的投射与撤回</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2697">44:57</a> 家庭、领导：权威松动的瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3094">51:34</a> 职业认同的整合与转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3293">54:53</a> 在工作中重塑自我，探索使命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3536">58:56</a>:MBTI?人格是流动的，别被标签固化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a>:灵魂拷问：你要走上这条荆棘密布的中年之路吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期提及｜</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>影视</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>电影：《基督最后的诱惑》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>书籍</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《中年之路：人格的第二次成型》[美] 詹姆斯·霍利斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>《炙热的你：关于了不起的女性更年期的一切》[德]希拉•德利兹/[德]路易莎•施托默尔</span></p><span></span><p><span>《月亮与六便士》[英] 威廉·萨默塞特·毛姆</span></p><span></span><p><span>《千面英雄》[美] 约瑟夫·坎贝尔</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜制作团队｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：余小白</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：除号</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：凯丁</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/660570fb2d9eae5d0aa4e9d1/lufQhpj3W-PwL8aCI5J2hm1Pqzj4.m4a" length="65960803" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhpg4MeVw62Oz2nJgMkaxWokCxWE.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>15</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
