  <item>
    <title>014.2025年终总结：在动荡的世界里，定义自己的生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697b802cb4be4c149b2c446c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697b802cb4be4c149b2c446c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 岁末年初，播客少产的一年都发生了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 嘉宾感受：努力活着的一年：多活一秒，再多一秒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> 今年的跨年夜：平淡但或许珍贵的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 曾经难忘的跨年记忆：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>跑进新年</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>说给陌生人的新年快乐</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>经济上行时期的跨年狂欢夜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="562">09:22</a> 世界风云变幻的一年，到了年末我们还记得什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a> tiktok难民涌入，互联网的一次复古记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="704">11:44</a> deepseek横空出示，技术突破带来的权威祛魅和AI带来的多重体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 自媒体时代对医患/咨访关系带来的冲击：传统的权威是自媒体时代的弱者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">16:19</a> 星辰陨落，明星的意外离世对我们的冲击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 一点点开心的事：飘红的股票，互掐的外卖平台</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>世界动荡不安，而你过得可还好？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1308">21:48</a> 陆西恩的繁忙的一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a> 虽然一路磕磕碰碰，但我们毕业了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 主播们咨询师的执业新体验：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>像海绵一样吸收新知识</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>放下对错标准看见独特的个体</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>入驻面试经历引发的思考</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> 除号的个人大记事：备考经历，是躺平还是找到自己的节奏 ，身体知道答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2192">36:32</a> 炸鸡有了新工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2273">37:53</a> 凯丁终于完成了一个flag，在旷野奔跑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2026许愿池</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2458">40:58</a> 世界和平，这很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2582">43:02</a> 活在当下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">45:14</a> 和不确定性相处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2752">45:52</a> 尝试新事物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2913">48:33</a> 新年寄语</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>陆西恩：每天做一点让自己感到自豪的事情</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>凯丁：新年的一年夜总还有事情可庆祝</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>炸鸡：认清生活的真相，依然热爱生活</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>除号：找回自己定义生活的权利</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期提及｜</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>歌曲</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>proud - JLS</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>文章</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JuV_5PNaHBU3P0Q0TrR9ew" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JuV_5PNaHBU3P0Q0TrR9ew"><span>大S 下凡</span></a><span> - 《人物》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜制作团队｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：炸鸡 🍠</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>@动背竹</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：除号</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：凯丁</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/660570fb2d9eae5d0aa4e9d1/lt5GCIS3qJ1ii_5hPS_iHGNzyId1.m4a" length="51319528" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhpg4MeVw62Oz2nJgMkaxWokCxWE.jpg"/>
