  <item>
    <title>013.AI追求完美，而我们拥抱脆弱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690f24dbaf4fc00da7bdaa75</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690f24dbaf4fc00da7bdaa75</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Nov 2025 11:12:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> 毕业仪式感，线下录制初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 备考、算命、写文案：大家都如何使用大模型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> &nbsp;AI幻觉：人类和AI谁更靠谱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="889">14:49</a> AI和认知行为疗法的适配性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> AI生成内容对认知与真实感的影响以及我们能做些什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> 炸鸡原来是女性？与大模型互动和人际关系的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">38:12</a> AI 作为一种心理支持、陪伴工具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2732">45:32</a> 我们该如何定义“关系”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3245">54:05</a> 对AI 的定位与展望：未来无限可能，体验不可替代</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期提及｜</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>书籍</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《笛卡尔的错误》安东尼奥·达马西奥</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜制作团队｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：炸鸡 🍠</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>@动背竹</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：除号</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：陆西恩、除号</span></p>]]></description>
