  <item>
    <title>012.飞往属于你的山，其实我也在这里</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68be754d9eb4a49300577314</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68be754d9eb4a49300577314</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Sep 2025 06:33:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 毕业在即，大花来袭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 成绩不重要，开心就好，真的开心吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> 陪伴从关上车门的一刻开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">6:26</a> 在女儿学校做义工，推开孩子世界的门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">7:44</a> 是坏情绪呀，没关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">9:40</a> 学习咨询以后，放下期待，专心陪伴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 主流叙事之下，成绩或许是建立人际联系的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 物质的丰富未必带来快乐，但稳定的陪伴可以</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> good enough的母女关系可能的样子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1567">26:07</a> 当孩子情绪来袭，如何应对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a> 亲子关系的走向，从陪伴到目送，再到告别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2256">37:36</a> 被养育者的成长，整合养育者的好与坏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2694">44:54</a> 养育的选择，回归家庭也是一种成长的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a> 动力学视角下，亲子关系模式的代际影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3189">53:09</a> 走出家庭来到广阔世界，生命有更多的养育者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3606">60:06</a> 离开家后的成长是看见父母在有限条件下的尽力付出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4144">69:04</a> 养育也是被看见的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4379">72:59</a> 心理咨询：从陪伴到重新养育，再到成为自己的养育者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4711">78:31</a> 离开是带着养育者的影响继续前行</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期提及｜</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>歌曲</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Goodbye's (The Saddest Word) - Céline Dion</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也在这里 - 窦靖童/王菲</span></p><span></span><p><span>请飞往属于你的山 - 昨夜派对（L.N Party）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>书籍</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《情绪养育》严艺家</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜制作团队｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：余小白</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：除号</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：凯丁</span></p>]]></description>
