    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 坦白局：多动？浮躁？爱走神？主播们与ADHD的结缘契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="801">13:21</a> ADHD的核心表现与个体差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> 禁锢在现代社会的远古猎人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a> 打破信息茧房，神经多样性了解下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> 全员A人还是注意力受损？神经多样如何在咨询工作中发挥影响力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2102">35:02</a> AA戒酒会？是A（DHD）A（SD）解救会：闪光之外的困扰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2264">37:44</a> 交给时间or使用工具：如何拯救A人的记忆力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2615">43:35</a> 放下诊断书，寻找说明书：后现代理念与A人的适配性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3089">51:29</a> 我们都一样，我们不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3384">56:24</a> 欢迎投稿！被遗忘了10期的邮箱：sanhuajudingpsy@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期提及｜</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>播客</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66acbda67349f7a5575360f7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66acbda67349f7a5575360f7"><span>005.《头脑特工队2》：无处不在的焦虑感，延迟体验的青春期｜影视万花镜</span></a><span> by 三花聚顶</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>书籍</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《看见她们：ADHD女性的困境》洛塔·博里·斯科格隆</span></p><span></span><p><span>《分心不是我的错》爱德华•哈洛韦尔/约翰•瑞提</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>影视</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《傲骨贤妻》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜制作团队｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：炸鸡 🍠</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSe