    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 有准备的即兴：无结构播客的诞生过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> 主题缘起：与炸鸡千丝万缕的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 睡意难挡，第一次暂停</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 朋辈爱の支持，第二次暂停</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 八仙过海：实习咨询师的自我照顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1161">19:21</a> 权衡需求与期待，第三次暂停</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> 推倒重来的勇气：艺术创作的快乐和播客品质的保证</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a> 状况外的主播对知识点的补救</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a> 知识点1：感受寒冷的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2138">35:38</a> 知识点2：时e时i，要社交，但不强迫性社交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2212">36:52</a> 知识点3：如何在边缘特质的春天中活下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2304">38:24</a> 知识点4：让一天延长的小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a> 自我照顾真正的干货和精华在这里！受益者现身说法</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：炸鸡 🍠</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>@动背竹</span></a></p><span></