  <item>
    <title>009.2024年终特辑：每一分钟都“还活着”，很多瞬间都不平凡</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6790f6dcb8be47e0c7f2efd3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6790f6dcb8be47e0c7f2efd3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jan 2025 14:00:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 年终总结 从托尔斯泰的“还活着”说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 被App总结的一年，我们不要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 自己做主的年终总结，让细节充实时间</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>去年回顾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 中二的年末评分：HP &amp; MP——看不懂就快来听听</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1121">18:41</a> 自己的奖自己颁：顺其自然、潜力、passion</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>灵魂拷问</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a> 所有人问所有人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a> 人生初体验：旅途、银河、极光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1866">31:06</a> 体验到的成长瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2331">38:51</a> 资源取向 看到优势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2741">45:41</a> 靠近idol的文化土壤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2914">48:34</a> 让万物穿过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3154">52:34</a> 最好的时光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3335">55:35</a> closer closer colser</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3847">64:07</a> 十年之问 关乎成长的平凡之路</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>新年展望</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4327">72:07</a> 新年新气象 你的slogan是什么</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期提及｜</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>歌曲</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Only Time - enya</span></p><span></span><p><span>最好的时光 - 安溥anpu</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>书籍</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《凯尔特神话全书》彼得·贝雷斯福德·埃利斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>《臣服实验》迈克·A·辛格</span></p><span></span><p><span>《中年之路》詹姆斯·霍利斯</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>播客</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61ee26c84675a08411f51570" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61ee26c84675a08411f51570"><span>E10 让万物穿过自己</span></a><span> by 无人知晓</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜制作团队｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：为封面和时间线操碎了心，还要想题目的 </span><strong><span>除号</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：初稿太烂，强行营业的 </span><strong><span>凯丁</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>封面：时间线被退稿，封面被甲方明改+暗改的 </span><strong><span>陆西恩</span></strong></p>]]></description>
