  <item>
    <title>008.《好东西》：多点好东西，明天会更好｜影视万花镜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67681a151e823e72d3d4dbe6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67681a151e823e72d3d4dbe6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 返场嘉宾自省式开场</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>part 1 什么是《好东西》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 好东西是一部怎样的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">03:51</a> 轻巧叙事，不讲主义，一部喜剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">05:28</a> 被看见、被理解、能确认</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> 比现实更现实，比理想更理想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> 抛开主义，看见生活</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>part 2 《好东西》里有什么</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 电影里被鼓励的小孩儿vs现实中卷不停的孩子们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> Not into LTR 都市丽人的无奈现实与心中渴望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">27:14</a> take it easy 亲密关系也可以是课间十分钟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1827">30:27</a> 女性互助：你本来就很美&amp;对所有人说的对不起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a> 背景中LGBT ，不被特别注视才是平等的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2433">40:33</a> 女鼓手要怎么打鼓？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2579">42:59</a> 多一个选择——做个观众也快乐？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2876">47:56</a> 声音蒙太奇——让隐形的家务被看见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3059">50:59</a> 比现实中可爱但不重要的男性角色</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>part 3 《好东西》之外</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3233">53:53</a> 电影之外，别用主义的框架抹掉生活的多样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3633">1:00:33</a> 伤害带给我们力量，而我们选择用它抚平伤痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3814">1:03:34</a> 主播们心中的“好东西”：自由、乐观、活着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4161">1:09:21</a> 带着好东西生活，让明天会更好</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：炸鸡 🍠</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>@动背竹</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：除号</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：凯丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：陆西恩</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljKBnt57AOvlByJ5X6zaCOVgTpiC.m4a" length="103919233" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:38</itunes:duration>
