  <item>
    <title>007.从800到半马，只差一点旭日和微风</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6756982cbdb9877a977048ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6756982cbdb9877a977048ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Dec 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期请到了万花丛中的小太阳——大胜，来和我们聊一聊运动与身心健康。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 由大胜的半程马拉松战绩引出的一些闲聊和科普</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 大胜与马拉松结缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 为什么体能测试和体育课都没让我们在学生时代爱上运动？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> 凯丁与除号和运动结（孽）缘的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 运动乐趣在文艺作品中的体现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> 大胜的长跑基础知识课堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a> 百闻不如一试——大胜美妙的运动体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2004">33:24</a>科学的运动和装备挑选——打消顾虑、减少伤痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2451">40:51</a> 陆西恩的运动历程和一些关于体育生的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2913">48:33</a> 运动中的伙伴力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3221">53:41</a> 认知行为疗法在运动中的应用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> 竞技体育中的存在主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3511">58:31</a> 巴黎奥运会杂谈</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：大胜</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：除号</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：陆西恩</span></p>]]></description>
