  <item>
    <title>006.吹过祛魅的风，走上实习的路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6702cd6c81cdab3a931fde30</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6702cd6c81cdab3a931fde30</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Oct 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 同步近况：放轻松，大家都在一边焦虑一边拖延</span></p><span></span><p><span>part 1.给高阶学习打个分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 凯丁：完成比完美更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a> 除号：奖励自己多一分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a> 陆西恩：保留一些进步空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">07:28</a> 自我批判的背后是不敢试错，学会接纳自己的不完美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 重复就是力量，拒绝纸上谈兵：对课程的感受和改进建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>part 2.高阶集训的新收获</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> 陆西恩：关系、伙伴和美食，无常中会开出惊喜的花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 除号：结构和当下并非对立，影响是潜移默化的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 凯丁：格局打开，咨询师也可以有不同面相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> 打破流派的墙，每个流派都是一个视角</span></p><span></span><p><span>part 3.对心理咨询的新认识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 凯丁：吃完鱼再学打渔、走出细节的漩涡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2161">36:01</a> 除号：相信自己的直觉，勇敢去提问</span></p><span></span><p><span>part 4.实习的挑战和期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2249">37:29</a> 陆西恩：维持长期关系、自我营销、督导</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 凯丁：慢慢来比较快、调整自我状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2503">41:43</a> 工作时的自我照顾很重要，不分工种</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2628">43:48</a> 大家在工作中学到的自我照顾技能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3053">50:53</a> 赋能时刻：面对即将到来的实习，我们的优势和力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a> 里程碑：坚持、放弃和重启都需要力量和勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：除号</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：陆西恩/除号</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：陆西恩（拍摄）</span></p>]]></description>
