    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWh-DlyVhfpUlg6hJm2G8UGumR9.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>6</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>005.《头脑特工队2》：无处不在的焦虑感，延迟体验的青春期｜影视万花镜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66acbda67349f7a5575360f7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66acbda67349f7a5575360f7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 Aug 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从童年期进入青春期，都会经历些什么？在全民焦虑的大背景下，被无限期延后体验的青春期又在我们的学生时代留下了怎样的烙印？面对焦虑，我们能做些什么？真正的自己既非那么好，也没那么坏，理解复杂性是我们通往整合的必经之路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们和万花丛中的另一位小伙伴——</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>炸鸡</span></a><span>（点击可前往嘉宾🍠）一起聊聊《头脑特工队2》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6">00:06</a> 神秘嘉宾 背景大公开，原来系出名门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 头脑特工队2 ，警报响起，青春期来袭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a> 青春期的第一个不同：自我意识的建立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> 青春期——控制台大改造</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 宇宙中心海淀区，如何度过青春期？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 陆西恩的叛逆期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a> 小镇青年的叛逆青春期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 青春期的第二个不同：新情绪出现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> 第一视角解读焦虑发作的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 成长的烦恼：青春期的焦虑体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1573">26:13</a> 越焦虑，越努力；越努力，越焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 与学姐crush：LGBT群体的形象固化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1946">32:26</a> 中二时期隐秘的偶像崇拜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2396">39:56</a> 消失的冰棒和脑后区的解读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2689">44:49</a> 乐乐的成长：长大后快乐会减少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a> 情绪动画形象解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3096">51:36</a> 焦虑与忧郁的切换共生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3169">52:49</a> 当我们开始体会到尴尬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3458">57:38</a> 焦虑的极致：惊恐发作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3503">58:23</a> 一些调节焦虑情绪的方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3939">65:39</a> 信念的整合，真实的我（好与不好）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4086">68:06</a> 如果有第三部：身份认同的整合？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a> 嘉宾总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">74:00</a> 彩蛋 冰棒的消失：告别与丧失</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：除号、凯丁、陆西恩（排名A→Z）</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：炸鸡 🍠</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5feb6c630000000001004331?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5feb6c630000000001004331&amp;apptime=1722602893&amp;share_id=2c03e54f075544fab346c88f838ea869&amp;wechatWid=1e20abea092731034d55d09b8336dadd&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>@动背竹</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：除号</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：凯丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：陆西恩</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkK-B0uxR9crTiSOQm48smZg0ujm.m4a" length="117441688" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3eY_Y7hrLs6CddHvw4j647kfW_.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>5</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
